# Test level - line of sight (LOS)
# W=wall, S=floor, D=door, P=player_spawn, E=enemy_spawn, F=dog_spawn, C=chest
# Wall column with a single gap at the open middle row.
# - Top enemy (7,2): inside aggro range but the wall blocks the line -> stays
#   idle until the player shows up through the gap.
# - Bottom enemy (7,5): clear diagonal line through the gap -> chases (and
#   attacks once within range with sight).
# - Dog (2,4): clear line, close range -> chases and bites; hide behind the
#   wall and it stops biting (no bite through walls) but keeps chasing.
W W W W W W W W W W
W S S S S W S S S W
W S P S S W S E S W
W S S S S W S S S W
W S F S S S S S S W
W S S S S W S E S W
W W W W W W W W W W
